{#
 Detail of the « confirm_registrations » step of the Année scoute workflow (chantier #930),
 written as the content of the step's Détails dialog. Receives `step`
 (Core\ScoutYear\Step\TransitionStep) and reads only `step.details`,
 `step.pendingMessage` and the step itself; the keys of `step.details` are
 documented on Core\ScoutYear\Step\Check\ConfirmRegistrationsStepCheck. The points to
 check, the actions and who marked the step are rendered by the page
 around this file, never here. Owned by the step checks (lot E); the page
 and the Détails dialog that include it are not.
#}
{% if step.details.pending is defined %}
<p class="small mb-2">
    {{ step.details.pending }} en attente ·
    {{ step.details.accepted }} {{ step.details.accepted <= 1 ? 'acceptée' : 'acceptées' }}
    {%- if step.details.accepted_without_section > 0 %} (dont {{ step.details.accepted_without_section }} sans section prévue){% endif %}.
</p>
{% endif %}
{% if step.details.blocking_request_count|default(0) > 0 %}
<div class="alert alert-warning small py-2 px-3 mb-2" role="note">
    Indépendamment de cette étape, la bascule publique reste refusée tant que
    {{ step.details.blocking_request_count }}
    {{ step.details.blocking_request_count <= 1 ? "demande d'inscription n'est pas clôturée" : "demandes d'inscription ne sont pas clôturées" }}.
</div>
{% endif %}
